#: ../../../devguide.rst:2
msgid "Development guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../devguide.rst:4
msgid ""
"`Contributing to psutil project <https://github.com/giampaolo/psutil/blob/"
"master/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_"
